10:T453,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/#organization","name":"M1sch1ef Managed","url":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/"},{"@type":"WebPage","url":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004","name":"The Hollow Hoard — Edition 4: The Beast Beneath Bell Row","description":"Something is crying beneath Bell Row. Stopping a dangerous pump test will take more than another daring escape.","inLanguage":"en","isAccessibleForFree":true,"publisher":{"@id":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/#organization"}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"M1sch1ef Comics","item":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/comics"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"The Hollow Hoard","item":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/comics/the-hollow-hoard"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"The Hollow Hoard — Edition 4: The Beast Beneath Bell Row","item":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004"}]}]}1:[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$10"}}],["$","$L11","the-hollow-hoard/issue-004",{"seriesSlug":"the-hollow-hoard","seriesTitle":"The Hollow Hoard","issue":{"slug":"issue-004","number":4,"title":"The Beast Beneath Bell Row","nextTitle":"The Price of a Name","summary":"Something is crying beneath Bell Row. Stopping a dangerous pump test will take more than another daring escape.","publishedAt":"2026-10-29T01:13:02.547Z","storyPages":12,"cover":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/00-cover.webp","pages":[{"number":0,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/00-cover.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"d6bb3cf9e219064f2f7f2f2b77b1768fc6e9b3161ae032c41eeddc7b3a5bc225","description":"The Beast Beneath Bell Row, Edition 4 of The Hollow Hoard: cover.","dialogue":[]},{"number":1,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/01.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"f46bb8f5597b5683108e23581656b27e526b15323156af24c7efcde614912cd3","description":"A deep knocking shakes the occupied Bell Row quay. Ren and Tamsin arrive as water starts breaking through its stone seams.","dialogue":["SFX: KONK... KONK... KONK","PARENT: Away from the edge.","REN: This is where they sent number three.","TAMSIN: Then we're late."]},{"number":2,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/02.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"65c8a7d74d1878a7d4f43849333d7e01b06b80bb61e9a5800430a365e9b34b38","description":"Workers connect a transport tank marked 003 to the pump. Inside, the captive Bellray taps against the glass under Dorn’s supervision.","dialogue":["WORKER: Keep the ray level.","REN: It's calling.","REN: Foreman Dorn?","DORN: It finds obstructions. New pump does the pushing.","TAMSIN: How long has it been working?","DORN: Since midday."]},{"number":3,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/03.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"a5f31583b5dd7664d402320be3dcbdb1f2dc9e38aca311d86de91b8b8e320557","description":"Ren shows Dorn the transfer evidence while Tamsin points out the leaking quay. The crew checks the gauges as the pump starts.","dialogue":["REN: The same system nearly killed another creature.","DORN: This is a delivery record. I need a fault I can test.","TAMSIN: Then watch the return pressure.","DORN: Call every rise."]},{"number":4,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/04.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"8464fce6c95c95b5d44d0faa9ed7f1e061ffb2fddd15f769cf9a6ccf0a9f4ab9","description":"Pressure rises too far. Ren follows Bellray’s repeated knocks toward a blocked side pipe and a covered gate.","dialogue":["WORKER: Return rising.","REN: Not random. It's pointing.","REN: It gets sharp here.","TAMSIN: An old guild return."]},{"number":5,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/05.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"9c4be228cab2b27584869fdbb9f2fdc2ef39a026408e7c59e410e5c19e1cfc88","description":"Tamsin identifies the old bypass. A museum order required it sealed, contradicting the dangerous pressure on the gauge.","dialogue":["TAMSIN: That return should open before the stroke.","DORN: We were told the old line wasn't safe.","REN: Sealing it traps the discharge.","SFX: KONK"]},{"number":6,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/06.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"e6401ba9c9d6bdd763348d24929de9421b2957e3c5a36d0e8f51f85e3799bac1","description":"The museum agent demands the test continue. Dorn pauses the pump and Tamsin stops the agent reaching its live control as the walkway cracks.","dialogue":["AGENT: The Curator promised a working pump.","DORN: Then we should make sure it works.","TAMSIN: Touch that and you own the flood.","SFX: KRRK"]},{"number":7,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/07.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"e41d7f1fa9ed5f31aaf2acccf5476f3e68770bb466aefb7cd200b9b0130bd466","description":"Ren plans an evacuation route, Tamsin checks the bypass approach and Dorn directs the crew. Together they confirm a safe sequence.","dialogue":["REN: I'll clear the quay and follow the knock.","TAMSIN: I can reach that gate.","DORN: I stop the powered stroke on your signal.","TAMSIN: Return first. Pump off. Then the restraint."]},{"number":8,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/08.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"6d4dc254210a2fbb04defa7ad19da802cad66dfcc906f258348f0268114fa291","description":"Tamsin crosses unstable boards with the borrowed kiln staff, catches a fixed rail and pulls herself toward the bypass wheel.","dialogue":["SFX: CREAK","REN: Tamsin!","TAMSIN: Keep them moving!","DORN: No one touches the drive."]},{"number":9,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/09.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"f7f3d2aaacab0ad9832b58ad7c4c24dee509f315eb0dc635116575c4fb433d99","description":"Ren locates the blocked return without opening a pressurized fitting. Tamsin turns the bypass while Dorn watches the gauge fall.","dialogue":["REN: Here. The cap's holding pressure.","REN: Not until the gate moves.","SFX: GRRNN","DORN: Stop the stroke. Now."]},{"number":10,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/10.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"89bcb20f2361588abe49fe68b1eb80df2d95d6bbf67a6439e84803cc0df3fafd","description":"Water returns to the old channel. Dorn disconnects the drive and Bellray stops straining against its restraint.","dialogue":["SFX: WHUMM","TAMSIN: Slow. Let it take the flow.","DORN: Feed dark.","REN: Now we can help it."]},{"number":11,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/11.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"1e51e870963d69aea199041f61a119a0c6a7da5d93c808fee15b3aa5b5989661","description":"With power removed, Dorn releases Bellray into an open maintenance pool and signs an incident report. Tamsin studies the old tidal-exchange plate.","dialogue":["DORN: I thought we were protecting the quay.","REN: You still can.","DORN: Take a copy. If they ask, I gave it to you.","TAMSIN: The archive should have this."]},{"number":12,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/images/12.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"fbe83c95b7162df11bc2c43e8df42fa6cce6dc0d5d2aefe8401ba416aca86acb","description":"After the rescue, Dorn recognizes Tamsin from her earlier service. Ren turns toward her, and the trust between the pair is suddenly uncertain.","dialogue":["DORN: Marr. You used to escort the museum wagons.","REN: You knew these people?","TAMSIN: Yes.","REN: Before we go anywhere else, tell me.","CAPTION: NEXT: THE PRICE OF A NAME."]}],"pdf":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004/The-Hollow-Hoard-04.pdf","pdfSha256":"558a0d03ea4d6ee503f0a5c1128a87dd0efeb64fe58008e0a98065e5d1d9c646","pdfBytes":21770507},"nextIssue":null,"nextReleaseAt":null,"seasonEnd":false}]]
